#X text 60 15 curve-editor as an LFO;
#X text 60 405 Drag the curve to shape one cycle of a repeating envelope.;
#X text 60 423 The curve values 0 to 1 set the volume of a 220 Hz tone.;
#X text 60 441 The LFO runs at half a cycle per second. Hear it repeat.;
#X text 60 465 Turn the volume down before you press play.;
#X text 60 483 Preset box loads a saved shape. Format is x y bend triples.;
